  "limits": [
    "Exact7caed4d/SDK7cb474, X/P1 and normal Zero/P2, shared native4:3 OpenGL/stacked meters, ordinary published digital inputs, dummy muted audio; same-machine Win64 loopback only.",
    "LOCAL uses the audited offline command9 earned-inventory prerequisite only. Its default trace is correctly tainted and both strict finalized capture/replay paths refuse it. Paired netplay uses the unchanged original1128 native FF QA card copied before startup, actual native title Load/story/selector/mission/arrival and finalized ordinary recordings. Neither path qualifies acquisition of all weapons.",
    "Original X type2 Ice Burst is selected and created through native R1/ Triangle; live original dispatch/contact words, source support box801F395C=00001010, actual ammo cost, ground activation and full finite allocation lifetime are retained. No block, HP, selection, pose, contact, position, velocity, timer or success values are authored.",
    "F22 requires actual other-character top support and native jump-on/jump-off plus original block retirement. F56 separately requires actual side blocking, finite reactions, neutral/standing top contact and subsequent independent controls. Saved partner history01/01 and08/01 support the native body/foot-box and composed observations; coordinates alone are insufficient.",
    "Read-only owned host histories, coherent published player/box data, ordinary actor pool, completed GPU frames and composed images are nearby independent observations, not an atomic whole-machine claim. Original block and Zero body box bytes are retained; no invented collision repair is used.",
    "The implementation keeps original X contact/result, isolates partner stage/personal-pool history, clears a resident weapon slot on native allocation, excludes projected Zero aliases and serializes current-build contacts in schema7. Both debug and production compiled regression tests pass, including slot reuse and snapshot restoration. No old-state migration or compatibility is required.",
    "All21 named composed interaction captures were root inspected. Native ice, both bodies/meters and scenery remain coherent. GPU dumps support identity/presentation; no original all-frame texture/palette equivalence or every-weapon/roster/platform claim.",
    "The pre-fix native failure and setup/observer failures remain unchanged. No source-only pass, unrelated native-content audit, independent views, boss/door progression or human-dependent qualification is claimed."
  ],
